  "justification": "Unprompted salience here centers on immediate harms and material tradeoffs: very high concern for the NHS/health and the cost of living/economy elevates Care and Proportionality. Immigration/sovereignty and security concerns boost Loyalty (and some Authority), while poverty/housing/education raise Equality and smaller attention to climate, lifestyle and contagion touches Sanctity.",
